  "label": "Ageism",
  "description": "The meme uses the image of an elderly woman falling to mock her physical abilities, which is a form of ageism. Ageism is the stereotyping and discrimination against individuals or groups based on their age, particularly older adults. The meme reinforces the idea that older people are less capable or more prone to accidents, which is a harmful societal bias.",
